{
  "dom_id": "step-175804",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Solving Linear Equations while Keeping the Variable on the Right-Hand Side",
  "problem": "Solve for $x$ where $2=5x-8.$",
  "worked_solution": "To save time, we will keep the variable on the right-hand side as we solve. First, we apply the addition principle, adding $8$ to both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2 & =5x-8 \\\\ 2+8 & =5x-8+8 \\\\ 10 & =5x+0 \\\\ 10 & =5x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSecond, we apply the multiplication principle, dividing both sides by $5\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10 & =5x \\\\ \\frac{10}{5} & =\\frac{5x}{5} \\\\ 2 & =\\frac{\\cancel{5}x}{\\cancel{5}} \\\\ 2 & =x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $2=x,$ we conclude that the solution is $x=2.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-175804\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"175804\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"12863\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-175804\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-6\">Solving Linear Equations while Keeping the Variable on the Right-Hand Side</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"175804\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                           